.SH NAME
CWE\-704 \- Incorrect Type Conversion or Cast
.SH RANK
KEV\-referenced weakness. Not part of the 2025 CWE Top 25; documented here because it appears in the CISA KEV catalog.
.SH CLASSIFICATION
Class: KEV\-referenced weakness.
.SH DESCRIPTION
The product does not correctly convert an object, resource, or structure from one type to a different type.
.SH KNOWN EXPLOITED VULNERABILITIES
